{"id":"0ae8ad45ec5345d3","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-ideal-fubini-product-ideal.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Fubini Product Ideal","display":"df-zfc-ideal-fubini-product-ideal — ZFC Ideal Fubini Product Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-fubini-product-ideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-fubini-product-ideal","58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-product"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-fubini-product-ideal — ZFC Ideal Fubini Product Ideal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-fubini-product-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-fubini-product-ideal</span><span>58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-fubini-product-ideal — ZFC Ideal Fubini Product Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal K\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal I,\\mathcal J,\\mathcal K\\in V\\)</span> (base sets and ideals)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdealFubiniProductIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdealFubiniProductIdeal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (ideal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}product\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdealFubiniProductIdeal}_S(\\mathcal K,X,\\mathcal I,Y,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal J,\\mathcal P(Y))\\land\n\\mathcal K=\\{A\\subseteq X\\times Y\\mid\n\\{x\\in X\\mid\\{y\\in Y\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\}\\notin\\mathcal J\\}\\in\\mathcal I\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}product\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcIdealFubiniProductIdeal}_S(\\mathcal K,X,\\mathcal I,Y,\\mathcal J)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal J,\\mathcal P(Y))\\land\n\\mathcal K=\\{A\\subseteq X\\times Y\\mid\n\\{x\\in X\\mid\\{y\\in Y\\mid\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in A\\}\\notin\\mathcal J\\}\\in\\mathcal I\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ideal7-ideal-product</code> is merged here; it used the same Fubini product section condition with explicit base sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor"